# Track the SessionStart hook + harness settings so Claude Code on the web can
# bootstrap a fresh container with Foundry + forge-std + the compiled artifact
# (otherwise 5 tests skip — see commit message for context), and so the calm
# MCP server config below actually reaches web sessions too.
