!.claude/settings.json
# Real `npx skills add okx/onchainos-skills` install (see skills-lock.json + demo_onchainos_
# composability.ts) — tracked so a reviewer gets the identical, hash-pinned skill files on
# clone instead of having to install them themselves before the composability demo lines up.
!.claude/skills/

